7D7AF]Master Gate shard 8 goes green.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Make the visual screenshot check clean on UTC runners[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]visual-lane[dim] · [dim][/dim]after modal-sizing[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]visual-lane: inventory golden drift with a full TZ=UTC screenshot check,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fix nondeterminism, regenerate only intended goldens, and prove the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]check clean.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Run Full CI on the repaired tip and fix every other red[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]full-ci[dim] · [dim][/dim]after ci-workflows[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]full-ci: get a Full CI run on a tip containing the build-core fix, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]triage every non-visual red job plus any other Master Gate red, and fix [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]what is deterministic.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Watch v0.18.1 through ci_watch, Publish, and PyPI with a [/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]self-closing monitor[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]watch[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-pin, ci-workflows, modal-sizing, visual-lane, full-ci[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]watch: make no repo edits; verify prerequisites, then start one [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]no-follow-up monitor whose watcher script always closes this bead and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exits 0.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-1nn","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-1nn.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-2fd4bc12d2603d3622c42f73081d5037","started_at":"2026-10-23T15:33:02.009168+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_reviva